		<article class="post-listing post-24952 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail  category-kesihatan-health" id="the-post">
			
			<div class="single-post-thumb">
			<img width="660" height="330" src="https://azhan.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Ultra-detailed-of-malay-old-man-laying-on-hospital-bed-660x330.jpg" class="attachment-slider size-slider wp-post-image" alt="" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" srcset="https://azhan.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Ultra-detailed-of-malay-old-man-laying-on-hospital-bed-660x330.jpg 660w, https://azhan.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Ultra-detailed-of-malay-old-man-laying-on-hospital-bed-1050x525.jpg 1050w" sizes="(max-width: 660px) 100vw, 660px" />		</div>
	
		


			<div class="post-inner">

							<h1 class="name post-title entry-title"><span itemprop="name">10 Tanda Buah Pinggang Anda Mungkin Sedang Rosak</span></h1>

						
<p class="post-meta">
	
	
	
</p>
<div class="clear"></div>
			
				<div class="entry">
					<div class="share-post">
	<span class="share-text">Share</span>

		<ul class="flat-social">
			<li><a href="http://www.facebook.com/sharer.php?u=https://azhan.co/?p=24952" class="social-facebook" rel="external" target="_blank"><i class="fa fa-facebook"></i> <span>Facebook</span></a></li>
				<li><a href="https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=10+Tanda+Buah+Pinggang+Anda+Mungkin+Sedang+Rosak&url=https://azhan.co/?p=24952" class="social-twitter" rel="external" target="_blank"><i class="fa fa-twitter"></i> <span>Twitter</span></a></li>
				<li><a href="http://www.stumbleupon.com/submit?url=https://azhan.co/?p=24952&title=10+Tanda+Buah+Pinggang+Anda+Mungkin+Sedang+Rosak" class="social-stumble" rel="external" target="_blank"><i class="fa fa-stumbleupon"></i> <span>Stumbleupon</span></a></li>
				<li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/shareArticle?mini=true&amp;url=https://azhan.co/10-tanda-buah-pinggang-anda-mungkin-sedang-rosak/&amp;title=10+Tanda+Buah+Pinggang+Anda+Mungkin+Sedang+Rosak" class="social-linkedin" rel="external" target="_blank"><i class="fa fa-linkedin"></i> <span>LinkedIn</span></a></li>
				<li><a href="http://pinterest.com/pin/create/button/?url=https://azhan.co/?p=24952&amp;description=10+Tanda+Buah+Pinggang+Anda+Mungkin+Sedang+Rosak&amp;media=https://azhan.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Ultra-detailed-of-malay-old-man-laying-on-hospital-bed-660x330.jpg" class="social-pinterest" rel="external" target="_blank"><i class="fa fa-pinterest"></i> <span>Pinterest</span></a></li>
		</ul>
		<div class="clear"></div>
</div> <!-- .share-post -->

					
					<div class='code-block code-block-5' style='margin: 8px auto; text-align: center; display: block; clear: both;'>
<!-- AFTER TITLE -->
<script async src="https://pagead2.googlesyndication.com/pagead/js/adsbygoogle.js?client=ca-pub-9375553653382118"
     crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
<!-- azhan2025-resp -->
<ins class="adsbygoogle"
     style="display:block"
     data-ad-client="ca-pub-9375553653382118"
     data-ad-slot="6401704858"
     data-ad-format="auto"
     data-full-width-responsive="true"></ins>
<script>
     (adsbygoogle = window.adsbygoogle || []).push({});
</script></div>
<p data-start="345" data-end="889">Buah pinggang merupakan salah satu organ terpenting dalam tubuh manusia. Walaupun manusia masih boleh hidup dengan hanya satu buah pinggang, fungsi yang dimainkan oleh organ ini amatlah besar dan tidak boleh dipandang ringan. Buah pinggang berperanan sebagai <strong data-start="604" data-end="633">penapis semula jadi badan</strong>, memastikan bahan buangan, toksin, serta lebihan cecair dikeluarkan melalui air kencing. Selain itu, ia juga membantu mengawal tekanan darah, menghasilkan sel darah merah, mengekalkan kekuatan tulang, serta mengimbangi paras mineral penting dalam tubuh.</p>
<p data-start="891" data-end="1275">Namun, apabila buah pinggang mula gagal berfungsi dengan baik, ia boleh menimbulkan pelbagai masalah kesihatan. Malangnya, ramai yang tidak menyedari tanda-tanda awal kerosakan buah pinggang kerana simptomnya sering kelihatan seperti masalah biasa. Oleh itu, sangat penting untuk kita mengetahui petunjuk awal agar rawatan boleh dilakukan segera sebelum keadaan menjadi lebih parah.</p>
<p data-start="1277" data-end="1356">Berikut merupakan <strong data-start="1295" data-end="1353">10 tanda utama buah pinggang anda mungkin sedang rosak</strong>.</p>
<hr data-start="1358" data-end="1361" />
<div id="ez-toc-container" class="ez-toc-v2_0_85 ez-toc-wrap-left counter-hierarchy ez-toc-counter ez-toc-grey ez-toc-container-direction">
<div class="ez-toc-title-container">
<p class="ez-toc-title" style="cursor:inherit">Isi Kandungan</p>
<span class="ez-toc-title-toggle"><a href="#" class="ez-toc-pull-right ez-toc-btn ez-toc-btn-xs ez-toc-btn-default ez-toc-toggle" aria-label="Toggle Table of Content"><span class="ez-toc-js-icon-con"><span class=""><span class="eztoc-hide" style="display:none;">Toggle</span><span class="ez-toc-icon-toggle-span"><svg style="fill: #999;color:#999" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="list-377408" width="20px" height="20px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M6 6H4v2h2V6zm14 0H8v2h12V6zM4 11h2v2H4v-2zm16 0H8v2h12v-2zM4 16h2v2H4v-2zm16 0H8v2h12v-2z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><svg style="fill: #999;color:#999" class="arrow-unsorted-368013" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="10px" height="10px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" version="1.2" baseProfile="tiny"><path d="M18.2 9.3l-6.2-6.3-6.2 6.3c-.2.2-.3.4-.3.7s.1.5.3.7c.2.2.4.3.7.3h11c.3 0 .5-.1.7-.3.2-.2.3-.5.3-.7s-.1-.5-.3-.7zM5.8 14.7l6.2 6.3 6.2-6.3c.2-.2.3-.5.3-.7s-.1-.5-.3-.7c-.2-.2-.4-.3-.7-.3h-11c-.3 0-.5.1-.7.3-.2.2-.3.5-.3.7s.1.5.3.7z"/></svg></span></span></span></a></span></div>
